before:
The supplied HTML is separate from the CSS.

```html
<form class="entry"><label for="name">Name</label><input id="name" name="name"><button type="submit">Save</button></form>
```

```css
.entry { font: 20px/1.4 sans-serif; }
.entry input, .entry button { font: inherit; box-sizing: border-box; min-height: 40px; padding: 6px 10px; }
.entry input { width: 200px; }
