after:
The supplied form has the class `entry`.

```css
.entry {
  font: 20px/1.4 sans-serif;
}
.entry input,
.entry button {
  font: inherit;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  min-height: 40px;
  padding: 6px 10px;
}
.entry input {
  width: 200px;
}
```

In `font`, `20px` is the text size and `1.4` after the slash is the line-height multiplier. The input and button inherit these settings. The input’s total width, including padding and border, is 200 pixels.
